  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "イングリッシュマスター  (An English Master)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "muranishi": "村西",
    "nakai": "中井",
    "okusama": "中井の妻"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "One wrong word nearly got Muranishi thrown out of Nakai's mansion, so he thinks fast. He promises Nakai that practicing a handful of cheerful English words will make him an instant hit abroad—and soon both men are shouting at the top of their lungs. Listen to Muranishi close his very first sale.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "めっそうもございません！お薦めする理由がもう一つあります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "何だ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "愛のコミュニケーションを取ることができます。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここに書かれている言葉を覚えて使えば大丈夫です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "例えば？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "シンプルに、オー、グッド、グッド！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "それだったら俺も言えるぜ。グッド！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "パーフェクトでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "ハロー！ラブ！グッド！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "あんたたち！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "奥様、明日からご主人はイングリッシュマスターになります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "買ってもいい？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "From panicked humility to triumphant applause, Muranishi rides every emotional wave in Japanese. Let's look at the key expressions.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "めっそうもございません！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Perish the thought!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "お薦めする理由がもう一つあります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'There is one more reason I recommend this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "ここに書かれている言葉を覚えて使えば大丈夫です。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you learn and use the words written here, you are all set.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "大丈夫です",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "例えば？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''For example?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "それだったら俺も言えるぜ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If that is all, I can say it too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "パーフェクトでございます！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''That is absolute perfection!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "あんたたち！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Hey, you two!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "okusama",
      "t": "たち",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "奥様、明日からご主人はイングリッシュマスターになります。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Madam, starting tomorrow your husband becomes an English master.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nakai",
      "t": "買ってもいい？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "''Can I buy it?'",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "muranishi",
      "t": "めっそうもございません！お薦めする理由がもう一つあります。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
